    IRCService --> ClientManager : uses (reference)
    CommandDispatcher *-- CommandContext : owns (creates in constructor)
    CommandDispatcher ..> IRCParser : parses with
    CommandDispatcher ..> CommandFactory : gets commands from
    CommandDispatcher o-- CommandHandler : chain head
    CommandDispatcher --> IRCMessage : consumes

    IRCParser --> IRCMessage : produces
    CommandFactory ..> Command : creates

    CommandHandler <|.. RegistrationCheckHandler
    CommandHandler <|.. ParamCheckHandler
    CommandHandler <|.. ExecutionHandler
    ExecutionHandler ..> Command : calls execute
    Command <|.. XxxCommand

    CommandContext o-- ClientManager
    CommandContext o-- ChannelManager
    CommandContext o-- NickManager
    CommandContext ..> Client : appends output to

    XxxCommand ..> CommandContext : uses
    XxxCommand ..> ReplyFormatter : uses

    ClientManager --> Client : map of clients
    Client *-- ClientBuffer : input / output buffers
